{
  "job_B9.2.7_20251003_115004": {
    "chunk_text": "heton buton f\u00e6der, & & he het ofslean ealle \u00fea Iudiscan men, for \u00feon \u00fee hie cristene men pinedon; \u00fea w\u00e6ron on & he bebead \u00fe\u00e6t mon timbrede on o\u00feerre stowe Hierusalem \u00fea burg, & \u00fe\u00e6t hie mon si\u00fe\u00fean hete \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s DCCC wintra & LXXXVIII, feng Ponpeius to & him sealde Iustinus se philosophus ane cristene boc for hiora freondscipe. Si\u00fe\u00fean he \u00fea geleornod h\u00e6fde, he wear\u00f0 cristnum monnum swa leof & swi\u00fee hold o\u00fe his lifes \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s DCCCC wintra & III, feng Marcus Antonius to Hie w\u00e6ron \u00fea \u00e6restan men \u00fee Romana onwald on tu tod\u00e6ldon; & hiene h\u00e6fden XIIII winter. & hie bebudon \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00e6lcne cristenne mon ofsloge. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m hie h\u00e6fdon micel gewin wi\u00f0 Parthe, for \u00feon \u00fee hie h\u00e6fdon awest ealle Capodotiam & \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m hie genamon fri\u00f0 wi\u00f0 Parthe. & him si\u00fe\u00fean becom on swa micel hungor & micel moncwealm, \u00fe\u00e6t heora feawa to lafe wurdon. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m him becom on \u00fe\u00e6t Denisc\u00e6 gewinn mid eallum Germanium. \u00dea on \u00fe\u00e6m d\u00e6ge \u00fee hie gefeohtan sceoldon, him com on swa micel h\u00e6te & swa micel \u00feurst \u00fe\u00e6t \u00dea b\u00e6don hie \u00fea cristnan men \u00fe\u00e6t hi heora an sume wisan gehulpen; & ongeaton \u00fe\u00e6t hit w\u00e6s \u00dea ab\u00e6don hie \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6lmihtegum Gode",
